sequenceDiagram
    participant browser as React
    participant ai as FastAPI
    participant backend as NestJS
    participant database as Application database
    ai->>backend: POST /internal/actions/return-preview
    backend->>backend: Authorize and validate proposed return
    backend->>database: Save exact action, actor, scope, and expiry
    backend-->>ai: actionId and preview only
    ai-->>browser: Deliver preview through the NestJS answer stream
    browser->>browser: Show order, reason, and consequence for confirmation
    browser->>backend: POST /actions/:id/confirm with idempotency key
    backend->>backend: Recheck session, permissions, expiry, and eligibility
    backend->>database: Execute return and record outcome atomically
    database-->>backend: Committed result
    backend-->>browser: Confirmed outcome and actionId
